  "details": "The new Main Menu Settings seem to be great! Basically all the settings which were in like 4 different menus before are now in one place! \n\n # Issue: \n\nA few settings are still missing from it how ever, we cannot enabled / disable the AFK detection, or change the HUD Position of the Action Menu. The most important thing missing however is probably going to be the OSC related settings.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nAll of these should be available in the Main Menu Settings as well.",
